DESCRIPTION:https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2iMiErHxi3prW3J2ZjFiChfhptt.jpg
 \n\nDocumentaire\, Musique\nUnited States of America\n\nRéalisateur : Nad
 ia Hallgren\nProduction : Interscope Films\, Boardwalk Pictures\, HYBE Ame
 rica\n\nActeurs :\n- Sophia Laforteza\n- Daniela Avanzini\n- Lara Raj\n- M
 egan Skiendiel\n- 정윤채\n- Manon Bannerman\n- Sohey Sugihara\n- Grant 
 Gilmore\n\n\n(synopsis non encore traduit sur TMDB)\nA captivating journey
  into KATSEYE's bold new era while celebrating the fans who helped make it
  possible. Featuring never-before-seen footage\, EYEKONS fan videos\, and 
 intimate interviews from the group members\, explore the powerful bond bet
 ween KATSEYE and their global fandom. A love letter to the EYEKONS who hel
 ped build this movement\, see why this group's story is only just beginnin
 g.\n\n\nFiche TMDB : https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1728113\n\nDonnées 
 fournies par The Movie Database (TMDB).\n
