SUMMARY:Lost Weekend Planetarium Experience
DESCRIPTION:https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yp9k8qw5OZZAT1qkXelull15cgx.jpg
 \n\nMusique\, Documentaire\nUS\n\nRéalisateur : Babak Tafreshi\nPhotograp
 hie : Babak Tafreshi\nProduction : COSM Studios\n\n\n(synopsis non encore 
 traduit sur TMDB)\nExperience Lost Weekend in a breathtaking audiovisual j
 ourney that travels from the star-filled skies of Madagascar and the shimm
 ering Northern Lights above Iceland's glaciers to the powerful storms acro
 ss Texas. Filmed in nearly 20 countries\, with no computer-generated image
 ry\, this show brings audiences closer to the natural world through stunni
 ng nightscapes that blend music\, science\, art\, and a sense of discovery
 .\n\n\nFiche TMDB : https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1745730\n\nDonnées f
 ournies par The Movie Database (TMDB).\n
