  :</b> COSM Studios</td></tr></table><p><i>(synopsis non encore traduit su
 r TMDB)</i><br>Experience Lost Weekend in a breathtaking audiovisual journ
 ey that travels from the star-filled skies of Madagascar and the shimmerin
 g Northern Lights above Iceland's glaciers to the powerful storms across T
 exas. Filmed in nearly 20 countries\, with no computer-generated imagery\,
  this show brings audiences closer to the natural world through stunning n
 ightscapes that blend music\, science\, art\, and a sense of discovery.</p
