 - Dicky Bahto\n- Joshua Peinado\n- Huw Lookingfore\n\n\n(synopsis non enco
 re traduit sur TMDB)\nA feature film that captures a travel into the villa
 ge of Lyssarea for the Temenos\, the inaugural screenings of Gregory J. Ma
 rkopoulos's Eniaios (2004-2026). From Athens to the region of Arcadia\, a 
 film about friend's wanderings\, the quietness of nature and an observatio
 n of the movement of light in Greece and the Peloponnese.\n\n\nFiche TMDB 
 : https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1748726\n\nDonnées fournies par The Mo
 vie Database (TMDB).\n
