 \n(名探偵コナン ハイウェイの堕天使 — Meitantei Conan: Hig
 hway no Datenshi)\n\nAnimation\, Action\, Mystère\, Crime\nJapan\n\nRéal
 isateur : 蓮井隆弘\nScénario : 大倉崇裕\nPhotographie : 西山仁
 \nProduction : TMS Entertainment\, TOHO\, Nippon Television Network Corpor
 ation\n\nActeurs :\n- Minami Takayama\n- Wakana Yamazaki\n- Rikiya Koyama\
 n- Megumi Hayashibara\n- Miyuki Sawashiro\n- Shin-ichiro Miki\n- 神奈延
 年\n- 横浜流星\n- 畑芽育\n- Akio Ōtsuka\n- Noriko Hidaka\n- 杉
 本ゆう\n\n\n(synopsis non encore traduit sur TMDB)\nWhen a string of de
 adly highway incidents begin\, Conan Edogawa's investigations point toward
 s an orchestrated plot rather than mere accidents. As he uncovers a conspi
 racy involving hidden identities and advanced technology\, the case escala
 tes into a high-speed race against time to stop a calculating mastermind b
 efore more lives are lost.\n\n\nFiche TMDB : https://www.themoviedb.org/mo
 vie/1545621\n\nDonnées fournies par The Movie Database (TMDB).\n
